      "dialogue": {
        "55e60faa0d7000fcad6d": "Yenniku stands stunned before you, his mind in another place...",
        "f81badedccc51345745f": "You place the Soul Gem upon his forehead.  He shudders as his soul is sucked in, leaving his body, a mindless husk, behind."
      },
